<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Colgate cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Colgate cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities said it downgraded Colgate-Palmolive Co to long-term buy from buy due to valuation.</p>
<p>-- reiterates belief that Colgate remains a core holding in the household products and personal care industries.</p>
<p>-- said believes Colgate remains on track for the current quarter and year.</p>
<p>-- said now expects Colgate's shares to perform &quot;relatively in line&quot; with the overall household products and personal care group in 1997.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $75 a share.</p>
<p>-- Colgate lost 5/8 to 65-5/8.</p>
</text>
